{
 "cells": [
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Which transfer matrices, acting on a global rotation, stay on one site? — $[2,1,0]^{\\otimes 2}$\n\nWrite-up: `L2-localizing-transfer.tex` / `.pdf`. The result summary is in the last cell.\n\nQuestion (Paul, 2026-09-23): take $\\langle u\\otimes u|$ with $\\langle u|=e_1^Te^{aE_{12}}e^{bE_{13}}e^{cE_{23}}$ (generic $a,b,c$, a global rotation) and act with $t_{\\{2,1\\}}(\\theta_1)$. Is the result $\\langle w\\otimes u|$ for some $\\langle w|$ (action on site 1 only)?\n\nConventions as `L2-det-mathcalA.wb`: $T_{ij}(x)=\\sum_k\\mathcal L^{(1)}_{ik}(x-\\theta_1)\\mathcal L^{(2)}_{kj}(x-\\theta_2)$, $\\mathcal L_{ij}(x)=x\\delta_{ij}-hE_{ji}$, twist $G=\\mathrm{diag}(z)$ on the right, $t_a$ = sum of principal quantum minors of $TG$ (column $k$ at $x-(k-1)h$), and the fused $t_{\\{\\cdot\\}}$ of `L1-orthogonality-diagonal-frame.wb` cell 5, e.g. $t_{\\{2,1\\}}(x)=t_2(x)t_1(x+h)-t_3(x+h)$. Covectors act from the left.\n\nCells: 2 GT machinery; 3 chain and fused $t$'s; 4 scan over $x=\\theta_s+nh$; 5 site-1 covector $w$ and rotation fits; 6 symbolic $a,b,c$; 7 point 2 with $u=\\mathrm{vacL}$; 8 $t_{\\{2,1\\}}(\\theta_1)^2$; 9 results.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ps[rep_] :=\n    ps[rep] =\n    Block[\n        {res = (Prepend[rep, #]& /@ (Tuples[Table[Range[rep〚1, i + 1〛, rep〚1, i〛], {i, 1, Length[rep〚1〛] - 1}]]))},\n        If[Length[res〚1, 1〛] == 1, Reverse @ Sort @ res, Reverse @ Sort @ Flatten[ps /@ res, 1]]\n    ];\ndim[rep_] := dim[rep] = Length[ps[{rep}]];\nJ0[k_][pat_] := J0[k][pat] = Sum[pat〚k, i〛, {i, 1, k}] - Sum[pat〚k - 1, i〛, {i, 1, k - 1}];\nJp[k_][pat_] :=\n    Jp[k][pat] =\n    -Sum[\n        Product[pat〚k, i〛 - i - pat〚k + 1, j〛 + j, {j, Range[k + 1]}]\n        / Product[pat〚k, i〛 - i - pat〚k, j〛 + j, {j, Complement[Range[k], {i}]}] v[ReplacePart[pat, {k, i} → pat〚k, i〛 + 1]],\n        {i, 1, k}\n    ];\nJm[k_][pat_] :=\n    Jm[k][pat] =\n    Sum[\n        Product[pat〚k, i〛 - i - pat〚k - 1, j〛 + j, {j, Range[k - 1]}]\n        / Product[pat〚k, i〛 - i - pat〚k, j〛 + j, {j, Complement[Range[k], {i}]}] v[ReplacePart[pat, {k, i} → pat〚k, i〛 - 1]],\n        {i, 1, k}\n    ];\nJJ[k_, l_, rep_] :=\n    JJ[k, l, rep] =\n    Which[\n        k == l,\n        DiagonalMatrix[J0[k] /@ ps[{rep}]],\n        l == k + 1,\n        Transpose[Table[Coefficient[Jp[k][ps[{rep}]〚i〛], v[#]]& /@ ps[{rep}], {i, 1, Length[ps[{rep}]]}]],\n        l == k - 1,\n        Transpose[Table[Coefficient[Jm[l][ps[{rep}]〚i〛], v[#]]& /@ ps[{rep}], {i, 1, Length[ps[{rep}]]}]],\n        l > k + 1,\n        JJ[k, k + 1, rep].JJ[k + 1, l, rep] - JJ[k + 1, l, rep].JJ[k, k + 1, rep],\n        l < k - 1,\n        JJ[k, k - 1, rep].JJ[k - 1, l, rep] - JJ[k - 1, l, rep].JJ[k, k - 1, rep]\n    ];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 1. L = 2 chain, both sites in repLc, exact rational point 1 of L2-det-mathcalA. Fused transfer matrices at a rational x, exact. ---- *)\nClearAll[repLc, dsLc, dcLc, idLc, ElLc, E1Lc, E2Lc, hLc, thLc, zLc, TatLc, qminLc, tGLc, tfLc];\nrepLc = {2, 1, 0};\ndsLc = dim[repLc]; dcLc = dsLc^2; idLc = IdentityMatrix[dsLc, SparseArray];\nElLc[i_, j_] := ElLc[i, j] = SparseArray[JJ[i, j, repLc]];\n(* site 1 (x) site 2, row-major: index (n1-1) dsLc + n2 *)\nE1Lc[i_, j_] := E1Lc[i, j] = KroneckerProduct[ElLc[i, j], idLc];\nE2Lc[i_, j_] := E2Lc[i, j] = KroneckerProduct[idLc, ElLc[i, j]];\n{hLc, thLc, zLc} = {1, {1/3, -8/57}, {5/2, 7/3, 6/35}};\n\nTatLc[i_, j_, x_] := Sum[((x - thLc[[1]]) KroneckerDelta[i, k] IdentityMatrix[dcLc, SparseArray] - hLc E1Lc[k, i]) . ((x - thLc[[2]]) KroneckerDelta[k, j] IdentityMatrix[dcLc, SparseArray] - hLc E2Lc[j, k]), {k, 3}];\nqminLc[II_, x_] := Sum[Signature[s] Dot @@ Table[TatLc[II[[s[[k]]]], II[[k]], x - (k - 1) hLc], {k, Length[II]}], {s, Permutations[Range[Length[II]]]}];\n(* G diagonal on the right: the principal minor of T G is the minor of T times prod z_I *)\ntGLc[a_, x_] := tGLc[a, x] = Sum[(Times @@ zLc[[II]]) qminLc[II, x], {II, Subsets[Range[3], {a}]}];\ntfLc[{0, 0}, x_] := IdentityMatrix[dcLc, SparseArray];\ntfLc[{1, 0}, x_] := tGLc[1, x];\ntfLc[{1, 1}, x_] := tGLc[2, x];\ntfLc[{2, 0}, x_] := tGLc[1, x] . tGLc[1, x + hLc] - tGLc[2, x + hLc];\ntfLc[{2, 1}, x_] := tGLc[2, x] . tGLc[1, x + hLc] - tGLc[3, x + hLc];\ntfLc[{2, 2}, x_] := tGLc[2, x] . tGLc[2, x + hLc] - tGLc[3, x + hLc] . tGLc[1, x];\n\n(* sanity: t1 and t2 commute, and t_{2,1} commutes with t1 *)\nGrid[{\n    {\"rep, dim of V (x) V\", {repLc, dcLc}},\n    {\"[t1(x), t2(y)] = 0 at x = 2/5, y = -3/7\", Max[Abs[tGLc[1, 2/5] . tGLc[2, -3/7] - tGLc[2, -3/7] . tGLc[1, 2/5]]] == 0},\n    {\"[t_{2,1}(x), t1(y)] = 0\", Max[Abs[tfLc[{2, 1}, 2/5] . tGLc[1, -3/7] - tGLc[1, -3/7] . tfLc[{2, 1}, 2/5]]] == 0}\n}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"928082\" data-output-id=\"0\" data-out-n=\"23\" data-sub-idx=\"20\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"2\" data-sub-start=\"22\" data-sub-end=\"26\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[23]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"13\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.64em;vertical-align:-1.55em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.09em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:3.6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-1.55em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">rep, dim of V (x) V</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">[t1(x), t2(y)] = 0 at x = 2/5, y = -3/7</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">[t_{2,1}(x), t1(y)] = 0</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:3.6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-1.55em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">64</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:3.6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-1.55em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[23]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{rep, dim of V (x) V} & \\left\\{\\left\\{2,1,0\\right\\},64\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{[t1(x), t2(y)] = 0 at x = 2/5, y = -3/7} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{[t\\_\\{2,1\\}(x), t1(y)] = 0} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
