   "value": "(* ---- 3. The site-1 covector w in <u (x) u| t(θ1) = <w (x) u| for t_{2,1} and t_{1,1}. Is w a rotation c e1 e^{a' E12} e^{b' E13} e^{c' E23}? ---- *)\nClearAll[wOfLc, fitLc, wLc];\nwOfLc[lab_] := Module[{M = Partition[uuLc . tfLc[lab, thLc[[1]]], dsLc], j},\n    j = First @ FirstPosition[uLc, _?(# != 0 &)];\n    M[[All, j]] / uLc[[j]]   (* M = w (x) u, read w off one column *)\n];\nfitLc[w_] := Module[{cc, a2, b2, c2, rot},\n    rot = cc UnitVector[dsLc, 1] . MatrixExp[a2 Normal[ElLc[1, 2]]] . MatrixExp[b2 Normal[ElLc[1, 3]]] . MatrixExp[c2 Normal[ElLc[2, 3]]];\n    Solve[Thread[Expand[rot] == w], {cc, a2, b2, c2}]\n];\nwLc = <|\"{2,1}\" -> wOfLc[{2, 1}], \"{1,1}\" -> wOfLc[{1, 1}]|>;\nGrid[{\n    {\"M = w (x) u exactly, t_{2,1}\", Partition[uuLc . tfLc[{2, 1}, thLc[[1]]], dsLc] == KroneckerProduct[wLc[\"{2,1}\"], uLc]},\n    {\"M = w (x) u exactly, t_{1,1}\", Partition[uuLc . tfLc[{1, 1}, thLc[[1]]], dsLc] == KroneckerProduct[wLc[\"{1,1}\"], uLc]},\n    {\"u (a, b, c) = (3/5, 4/7, -2/9)\", uLc},\n    {\"w for t_{2,1}(θ1)\", wLc[\"{2,1}\"]},\n    {\"rotation fit of w, t_{2,1}\", fitLc[wLc[\"{2,1}\"]]},\n    {\"w for t_{1,1}(θ1)\", wLc[\"{1,1}\"]},\n    {\"rotation fit of w, t_{1,1}\", fitLc[wLc[\"{1,1}\"]]},\n    {\"w_{2,1} / w_{1,1} (componentwise)\", wLc[\"{2,1}\"] / wLc[\"{1,1}\"]}\n}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
