  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 4. Symbolic u (a, b, c free): <u (x) u| t_{2,1}(θ1) = C <u' (x) u| exactly, with u' the rotation at (a z2/z1, b z3/z1, c z3/z2) = e1 G^-1 g G,\n   i.e. the twist acting on site 1 only. C is u-independent, so it is the eigenvalue of t_{2,1}(θ1) on the vacuum <e1 (x) e1|. ---- *)\nClearAll[usS, uusS, MS, wS, locSymS, rotFitS, vacEigS];\nusS = Expand[UnitVector[dsLc, 1] . MatrixExp[aS Normal[ElLc[1, 2]]] . MatrixExp[bS Normal[ElLc[1, 3]]] . MatrixExp[cS Normal[ElLc[2, 3]]]];\nuusS = Flatten[KroneckerProduct[usS, usS]];\nMS = Expand[Partition[uusS . tfLc[{2, 1}, thLc[[1]]], dsLc]];\nwS = Together[MS[[All, 1]] / usS[[1]]];\nlocSymS = Simplify[Expand[MS - KroneckerProduct[wS, usS]]] === ConstantArray[0, {dsLc, dsLc}];\nrotFitS = Module[{cc, a2, b2, c2},\n    Factor[Solve[Thread[Expand[cc UnitVector[dsLc, 1] . MatrixExp[a2 Normal[ElLc[1, 2]]] . MatrixExp[b2 Normal[ElLc[1, 3]]] . MatrixExp[c2 Normal[ElLc[2, 3]]]] == wS], {cc, a2, b2, c2}]]\n];\nvacEigS = Module[{e11 = Flatten[KroneckerProduct[UnitVector[dsLc, 1], UnitVector[dsLc, 1]]], r},\n    r = e11 . tfLc[{2, 1}, thLc[[1]]]; {r[[1]], Max[Abs[r - r[[1]] e11]] == 0}];\nGrid[{\n    {\"<u (x) u| t_{2,1}(θ1) = <w (x) u| for all a, b, c\", locSymS},\n    {\"w = C e1 e^{a' E12} e^{b' E13} e^{c' E23}\", rotFitS},\n    {\"(a'/a, b'/b, c'/c) vs (z2/z1, z3/z1, z3/z2)\", {rotFitS[[1, 2, 2]] / aS, rotFitS[[1, 3, 2]] / bS, rotFitS[[1, 4, 2]] / cS} == {zLc[[2]] / zLc[[1]], zLc[[3]] / zLc[[1]], zLc[[3]] / zLc[[2]]}},\n    {\"vacuum eigenvalue of t_{2,1}(θ1), <e1 (x) e1| eigen?\", vacEigS},\n    {\"C = vacuum eigenvalue\", rotFitS[[1, 1, 2]] == vacEigS[[1]]}\n}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
