  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Result (cell 15, exact at point 1, finite twist)\n\n- The 64 SoV covectors have rank 64. The localizing combinations $\\sum_xc_x\\langle x|=\\langle v\\otimes\\mathrm{vacL}|$ form an **8-dimensional** space. **Only 12 of the 64 labels ever appear.**\n- The minimal combinations are 4 single labels and 4 pairs. Together they span the whole 8-dimensional space:\n\n| minimal combination (site 1 \\| site 2, $n_{21}n_{11}n_{12}$) | coefficients | site-1 weights of $v\\,g_0^{-1}$ |\n|---|---|---|\n| $100\\|100$ (vacuum) | 1 | $(2,1,0)$ |\n| $111\\|100$ | 1 | $(2,1,0),(2,0,1),(1,1,1)$ |\n| $200\\|100$ | 1 | $(2,1,0),(1,2,0)$ |\n| $211\\|100$ | 1 | $+(0,2,1)$ |\n| $100\\|200,\\ 110\\|100$ | $-19/9,\\ 1$ | $(2,1,0),(2,0,1),(1,2,0)$ |\n| $200\\|200,\\ 210\\|100$ | $-19/14,\\ 1$ | $+(1,1,1)$ |\n| $210\\|200,\\ 220\\|100$ | $-95/203,\\ 1$ | $+(1,0,2)$ |\n| $211\\|200,\\ 221\\|100$ | $-19/28,\\ 1$ | **all 8, including $(0,1,2)$** |\n\n- **Pattern.** The single labels have site 2 in the vacuum label $100$, and their $n_{11}\\in\\{0,1\\}$ equals $n_{12}$ ($100,111,200,211$). Each pair is $\\{g|200,\\ g^+|100\\}$, where $g^+$ raises $n_{11}$ of $g$ by one: $100\\to110$, $200\\to210$, $210\\to220$, $211\\to221$. So the site-2 label $\\{2\\},\\{0,0\\}$ is traded against one site-1 $n_{11}$ step. The coefficients carry the $19$ of $\\theta_{12}=9/19$ (the first is $-1/\\theta_{12}$).\n- **Consequence.** The 8 site-1 covectors $v\\,g_0^{-1}$ have rank 8. So after undoing $g_0\\otimes g_0$, every $v\\otimes e_1^T$ is a combination of these 12 labels. This includes the weights $(1,0,2)$ and $(0,1,2)$, which the $\\langle k_1Q_1\\rangle\\langle k_2Q_{12}\\rangle$ family never reaches. In particular $\\langle x_{221|100}|-\\tfrac{19}{28}\\langle x_{211|200}|$ reaches $(0,1,2)$, the component that pairs with the singlet.\n- Still open: the analytic form of the coefficients (a scan in $\\theta,z,p$), and whether these pairs have a Q-functional realization.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Site-2 mirror: which SoV covectors act on site 2 only? (Paul, 2026-09-25)\n\nSame basis and point as cell 15. We now seek $\\sum_xc_x\\langle x|=\\langle\\mathrm{vacL}\\otimes w|$, so site 1 stays in the reference. In the $8\\times8$ reshape $M$ (rows = site 1), every column must be $\\propto\\mathrm{vacL}$, i.e. $q\\cdot M=0$ for all $q$ with $\\mathrm{vacL}\\cdot q=0$. We check single labels first, then the full coefficient space and its minimal supports.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 10. Site-2 mirror of cell 15: c . sovX = vacL (x) w, i.e. every column of the site1 x site2 reshape is ∝ vacL. ---- *)\nClearAll[A2Lc, C2Lc, minSupp2Lc, circ2Lc, w2OfLc, single2Lc, single1Lc];\nA2Lc = Table[Flatten[QvLc . Partition[x, dsLc]], {x, sovXLc}];\nC2Lc = NullSpace[Transpose[A2Lc]];\n(* single labels that are already of product form, on either site *)\nsingle2Lc = Select[Range[64], AllTrue[A2Lc[[#]], # == 0 &] &];\nsingle1Lc = Select[Range[64], AllTrue[ALc[[#]], # == 0 &] &];\nminSupp2Lc[kmax_] := Module[{found = {}},\n    Do[Do[If[NoneTrue[found, SubsetQ[S, #] &] && MatrixRank[A2Lc[[S]]] < Length[S], AppendTo[found, S]], {S, Subsets[Range[64], {k}]}], {k, 1, kmax}];\n    found];\ncirc2Lc = minSupp2Lc[3];\n(* the site-2 covector w of a circuit (c . sovX = vacL (x) w) *)\nw2OfLc[S_] := With[{c = First[NullSpace[Transpose[A2Lc[[S]]]]]}, With[{M = Partition[c . sovXLc[[S]], dsLc]}, M[[1]] / vacLLc[[1]]]];\nColumn[{\n    Grid[{\n        {\"single labels acting on site 1 only\", Row[labStr[labsLc[[#]]] & /@ single1Lc, \", \"]},\n        {\"single labels acting on site 2 only\", If[single2Lc === {}, \"none\", Row[labStr[labsLc[[#]]] & /@ single2Lc, \", \"]]},\n        {\"dim C2 (site-2 localizing combinations)\", Length[C2Lc]},\n        {\"labels that ever appear in C2\", Length[Union @@ (Flatten[Position[#, _?(# != 0 &)]] & /@ C2Lc)]},\n        {\"minimal supports found (size ≤ 3)\", Length[circ2Lc]},\n        {\"they span C2\", If[circ2Lc === {}, \"-\", MatrixRank[Table[ReplacePart[ConstantArray[0, 64], Thread[S -> First[NullSpace[Transpose[A2Lc[[S]]]]]]], {S, circ2Lc}]] == Length[C2Lc]]},\n        {\"rank of their site-2 covectors w g0^-1\", If[circ2Lc === {}, \"-\", MatrixRank[Table[w2OfLc[S] . Inverse[g0Lc], {S, circ2Lc}]]]}\n    }, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left],\n    If[circ2Lc === {}, \"no minimal support of size ≤ 3\", Grid[Prepend[Table[{Row[Map[labStr[labsLc[[#]]] &, S], \" , \"], With[{c = First[NullSpace[Transpose[A2Lc[[S]]]]]}, c / Last[c]],\n        Union[Table[If[(w2OfLc[S] . Inverse[g0Lc])[[n]] != 0, wtsLc[[n]], Nothing], {n, dsLc}]]}, {S, circ2Lc}],\n        {\"minimal support (site1|site2 labels n21 n11 n12)\", \"coefficients\", \"site-2 weights of w g0^-1\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]]\n}]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
