  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 12. Does the full C2 reach every site-2 weight? rank of the 8 site-2 covectors w g0^-1 over a basis of C2, plus a direct check of the product form. ---- *)\nGrid[{\n    {\"every c in C2 gives vacL (x) w\", AllTrue[Flatten[Table[QvLc . Partition[c . sovXLc, dsLc], {c, C2Lc}]], # == 0 &]},\n    {\"rank of site-2 covectors w g0^-1 over C2\", MatrixRank[Table[Partition[c . sovXLc, dsLc][[1]] . Inverse[g0Lc], {c, C2Lc}]]}\n}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
